Package: JevR
Type: Package
Title: R Client for the TypeSafe Jev System One API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jens", "von Bergmann", email = "jens@mountainmath.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ask typed questions about text or structured data using TypeSafe's
    Jev System One model <https://docs.typesafe.ai>. Build noul (yes/no), choice
    and score questions, send them in a single request, and get the answers back
    as tidy data frames. Includes a batch helper for running the same questions
    over many records with retries and progress reporting.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/mountainMath/JevR
BugReports: https://github.com/mountainMath/JevR/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite,
    purrr (>= 1.0.0),
    rlang,
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    dplyr,
    knitr,
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
